{
  "title": "PhysicsDebugDraw",
  "description": "`DebugLayer` that visualises a PhysicsWorld - shapes, AABBs, contacts, normals, centres and broad-phase links. It reads the world's public state and recomputes contacts/broad-phase locally only while visible, so it never perturbs the simulation and works over any backend. Lives in the `./debug` subpath so it tree-shakes out of production bundles.",
